Third-party notices for the native DeepSeek V4.1 Flash ("Maya") port

ds4
---
Portions of this directory are derived from https://github.com/audreyt/ds4
at revision 0dff39f91721bcf3472813c6d2bebf9353df2a1a, including ported parts of:
  ds4.c: text graph, residual streams, attention, routing and precision boundaries
  ds4_metal.m: projection dispatch, normalization and cache execution geometry
  ds4_engram.c, ds4_engram.h, tests/test_engram.c: Engram and regression fixtures
  metal/dsv41.metal: V4.1 native operations
  metal/dsv4_kv.metal: KV quantize/dequantize and cache arithmetic
  metal/dsv4_hc.metal: hyperconnections and residual-stream arithmetic
  metal/norm.metal: RMS normalization arithmetic and reduction layout
  metal/dense.metal: packed Q8 projection arithmetic and reduction layout,
    including the rows_seq4 kernel (dense.metal:505-587, ds4_metal.m:20059-20162)
  metal/get_rows.metal: F32 Q8 embedding decode
  metal/argsort.metal: selection and tie ordering
  metal/moe.metal, metal/iq1s_grid.metal: IQ1_S expert arithmetic and grid

